{%- comment -%}
  "Build your SNH plan" (Round 10; the Round 8 onboarding quiz, deeper and gamified). Used by the member app's Goals
  view, the register page (step 3) and the QA mock.
  12 questions with branching (R19: the budget question is gone) (assets/snh-app.js reads data-if): primary goal · secondary goal (the primary one is
  hidden) · experience level · training days · session type · sport · diet · supplement experience · what
  you already take (multi, only if not new to supplements) · biggest challenge · flavour (not for daily health) · age
  range + birthday + mobile (contact: true).
  Gamified: XP bar that fills per answer, one-tap tiles with icons, a "level up" at the halfway point. App mode adds
  the results: the "Shake your shaker" tap game (5 s, just for fun, no points or discounts), then "Your SNH stack"
  (3–5 products from snh-quiz-stackdata, why each fits, total, a bundle saving if one applies), a tip card and a
  shareable plan card (PNG via canvas).
  Questions/answers: "Quiz question" blocks (step, question, help, answers "value | label | icon" per line), else the
  defaults below. Answers become compact tags (ELITE-ROADMAP.md §4): goal: goal2: lvl: freq: sess: sport: diet:
  exp: take: (one per item) challenge: flavour: age: bday: mobile:.
  Saving (Round 10): one normal page POST, never fetch, so Shopify's hCaptcha runs. App mode: "Save my plan" on the
  results is the submit button of the customer form below (POST /contact, contact[tags], data-shopify-captcha), back
  to /account#goals with a banner. Register mode: answers fill customer[tags] on the create_customer form; radios
  belong to no form (form="…-none"), so only the tags field posts. mock: true never submits.
  blocks · id (unique) · mode: 'app' | 'register' | 'guest' · contact · email · a: current answers as tags string (preselect)
  · phone · bday · stack: stack categories setting · bundle_handles · mock · return_to (app mode)
  R18: mode 'guest' (homepage quiz band, signed out) = app mode without the save form: results show the stack and the
  free workout plan (data-wk-plan), and sections/snh-quiz-band moves its sign-up gate into data-wk-gate-slot.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign keys = 'goal,goal2,lvl,freq,sess,sport,diet,exp,take,challenge,flavour,age' | split: ','
  assign cur_tags = a | default: '' | downcase | remove: ' ' | split: ','
  assign total = keys.size
-%}
<div class="quiz qz" data-quiz data-mode="{{ mode | default: 'app' }}" id="{{ id }}"{% if mock %} data-mock{% endif %} data-total="{{ total }}">
  <div class="qz__top">
    <div class="qz__xp" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="qz__lvl" data-qz-lvl>Level 1</span>
      <div class="qz__bar"><i data-quiz-bar></i></div>
      <span class="qz__pts" data-qz-xp>0 XP</span>
    </div>
    <p class="quiz__count" data-quiz-count aria-live="polite">Question 1 of {{ total }}</p>
  </div>

  {%- for k in keys -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign q = ''
      assign help = ''
      assign answers = ''
      for b in blocks
        if b.type == 'quiz' and b.settings.step == k and b.settings.answers != blank
          assign q = b.settings.question
          assign help = b.settings.help
          assign answers = b.settings.answers | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
        endif
      endfor
      assign type = 'one'
      assign cond = ''
      case k
        when 'goal'
          assign dq = "What's your main goal right now?"
          assign dh = 'Pick the one that matters most. You can change it any time.'
          assign da = 'build-muscle | Build muscle | dumbbell,lose-fat | Lose fat | flame,endurance | Endurance | run,hydration-recovery | Hydration & recovery | drop,daily-health | Daily health | heart,sport-specific | Sport performance | trophy'
        when 'goal2'
          assign dq = 'Anything else you want from your stack?'
          assign dh = 'A second goal. Skip if one is enough.'
          assign da = 'build-muscle | Build muscle | dumbbell,lose-fat | Lose fat | flame,endurance | Endurance | run,hydration-recovery | Hydration & recovery | drop,daily-health | Daily health | heart,sport-specific | Sport performance | trophy'
        when 'lvl'
          assign dq = 'How long have you been training?'
          assign dh = 'Honest answers get better picks.'
          assign da = 'beginner | Just starting | sparkle,intermediate | 1–3 years | bolt,advanced | 3+ years | trophy'
        when 'freq'
          assign dq = 'How many days a week do you train?'
          assign dh = 'A normal week, roughly.'
          assign da = '1-2x | 1–2 days | clock,3x | 3 days | clock,4x | 4 days | bolt,5x | 5 days | flame,6x | 6–7 days | trophy'
        when 'sess'
          assign dq = 'What do most sessions look like?'
          assign dh = 'Your usual workout.'
          assign da = 'strength | Weights & strength | dumbbell,cardio | Cardio & running | run,hiit | HIIT & classes | flame,mixed | A bit of everything | refresh,skill | Sport practice | ball'
        when 'sport'
          assign dq = "What's your main sport?"
          assign dh = 'For match-day tips and guides.'
          assign da = 'cricket | Cricket | bat,padel | Padel | racket,running | Running | run,gym | Gym | dumbbell,cycling | Cycling | bike,swimming | Swimming | wave,football | Football | ball,rugby | Rugby | ball,other | Something else | star'
        when 'diet'
          assign dq = 'How do you eat?'
          assign dh = 'So we never suggest something you avoid.'
          assign da = 'none | No preference | smile,vegetarian | Vegetarian | leaf,vegan | Vegan | leaf,lactose-free | Lactose-free | drop'
        when 'exp'
          assign dq = 'How well do you know supplements?'
          assign dh = 'No wrong answers.'
          assign da = 'new | New to them | sparkle,some | Tried a few | pill,experienced | I know my stack | trophy'
        when 'take'
          assign type = 'many'
          assign cond = 'exp!=new'
          assign dq = 'What do you already take?'
          assign dh = 'Pick all that apply. We won’t suggest them again.'
          assign da = 'protein | Protein | shaker,creatine | Creatine | dumbbell,pre-workout | Pre-workout | bolt,electrolytes | Electrolytes | drop,multivitamin | Multivitamin | pill,omega-3 | Omega-3 | heart,magnesium | Magnesium | moon'
        when 'challenge'
          assign dq = "What's your biggest challenge?"
          assign dh = 'We’ll put this first in your tips.'
          assign da = 'energy | Energy | bolt,recovery | Recovery | refresh,cravings | Cravings | cup,consistency | Consistency | target,sleep | Sleep | moon'
        when 'flavour'
          assign cond = 'goal!=daily-health'
          assign dq = 'Pick a flavour team'
          assign dh = 'For shakes and drinks.'
          assign da = 'chocolate | Chocolate | cup,vanilla | Vanilla & cookies | sparkle,fruity | Fruity | drop,unflavoured | Unflavoured | shaker,any | Surprise me | star'
        else
          assign dq = 'Last one: your age'
          assign dh = 'Age ranges help us tune doses and tips.'
          assign da = '18-24 | 18–24 | sparkle,25-34 | 25–34 | bolt,35-44 | 35–44 | target,45-plus | 45+ | heart'
      endcase
      if answers == ''
        assign answers = da | split: ','
      endif
      assign q = q | default: dq
      assign help = help | default: dh
    -%}
    <fieldset class="quiz__step qz__step" data-step="{{ k }}" data-type="{{ type }}"{% if cond != '' %} data-if="{{ cond }}"{% endif %} hidden>
      <legend class="quiz__q">{{ q | escape }}</legend>
      {%- if help != blank -%}<p class="quiz__help">{{ help | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <div class="qz__tiles">
        {%- for an in answers -%}
          {%- assign pr = an | split: '|' -%}
          {%- assign val = pr[0] | strip | handleize -%}
          {%- if val == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign lab = pr[1] | default: pr[0] | strip -%}
          {%- assign ic = pr[2] | strip | default: 'check' -%}
          {%- assign tag = k | append: ':' | append: val -%}
          <label class="qz__tile"><input type="{% if type == 'many' %}checkbox{% else %}radio{% endif %}" name="{{ id }}-{{ k }}" value="{{ val }}"{% if mode == 'register' %} form="{{ id }}-none"{% endif %}{% if cur_tags contains tag %} checked{% endif %} data-label="{{ lab | escape }}"><span class="qz__ic" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: ic %}</span><span class="qz__l">{{ lab | escape }}</span></label>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      {%- if k == 'age' and contact -%}
        <div class="aform__grid qz__contact">
          <label class="fld"><span>Birthday <i class="quiz__opt-l">(optional, for your birthday reward)</i></span><input type="date" data-quiz-bday min="1930-01-01" max="{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}" value="{{ bday | escape }}" autocomplete="bday"></label>
          <label class="fld"><span>Mobile number</span><input type="tel" data-quiz-mobile data-sl-mobile data-tel94 inputmode="tel" value="{{ phone | escape }}" placeholder="77 123 4567" autocomplete="tel" aria-describedby="{{ id }}-mob-err"></label>
          <p class="fld__err fld--full" id="{{ id }}-mob-err" hidden data-sl-err>Enter a Sri Lankan mobile number, like 077 123 4567 or +94 77 123 4567.</p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </fieldset>
  {%- endfor -%}

  <div class="qz__lvlup" data-qz-levelup hidden aria-live="polite">
    <span class="qz__badge" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: 'trophy' %}</span>
    <p><b>Level up!</b> Halfway there. Your plan is taking shape.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="quiz__done" data-step="done" hidden tabindex="-1">
    <p class="quiz__q">You're all set</p>
    <p class="quiz__help" data-quiz-summary></p>
  </div>

  {%- if mode != 'register' -%}
    <div class="qz__game" data-step="game" hidden tabindex="-1">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your stack is mixing</p>
      <p class="quiz__q">Shake your <em>shaker</em></p>
      <p class="quiz__help" data-qz-game-help>Tap the shaker as fast as you can for 5 seconds to reveal your stack.</p>
      <button class="qz__shaker" type="button" data-qz-shake aria-label="Shake the shaker">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 180" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="{{ id }}-cup"><path d="M22 52h76l-8 118H30z"/></clipPath></defs><rect x="30" y="18" width="60" height="30" rx="6" class="qz__lid"/><rect x="48" y="6" width="24" height="16" rx="4" class="qz__lid"/><path d="M22 52h76l-8 118H30z" class="qz__cup"/><g clip-path="url(#{{ id }}-cup)"><rect x="0" y="170" width="120" height="120" class="qz__liq" data-qz-liq/></g><path d="M22 52h76l-8 118H30z" class="qz__glass"/><text x="60" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="qz__logo">SNH</text></svg>
      </button>
      <div class="qz__meter"><i data-qz-meter></i></div>
      <p class="qz__score" data-qz-score aria-live="polite">0 shakes</p>
      <button class="v-link quiz__skip" type="button" data-qz-skipgame>Skip the game</button>
    </div>

    <div class="qz__res" data-step="results" hidden tabindex="-1">
      <div class="qz__res-h">
        <p class="eyebrow">Your plan</p>
        <h3 class="app__h2">Your SNH <em>stack</em></h3>
        <p class="app__muted" data-qz-res-sum></p>
      </div>
      <ol class="qz__stack" role="list" data-qz-stack></ol>
      <div class="qz__tot" data-qz-tot></div>
      <aside class="qz__tip" data-qz-tip></aside>
      <div class="wk" data-wk-plan hidden></div>
      <div class="wk-gate-slot" data-wk-gate-slot></div>
      <div class="qz__share">
        <canvas class="qz__card" width="1080" height="1350" data-qz-canvas role="img" aria-label="Your SNH plan card"></canvas>
        <div class="qz__share-b">
          <p class="app__h3">Your plan card</p>
          <p class="app__muted">Save it, share it, screenshot it for the gym.</p>
          <button class="v-btn v-btn--line v-btn--sm" type="button" data-qz-png>{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: 'arrow' %}<span>Download PNG</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="app__note">Picks are general guidance from your answers, not medical advice. The game is just for fun: no points or discounts.</p>
    </div>
    {%- render 'snh-quiz-stackdata', map: stack, handles: bundle_handles -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="quiz__nav">
    <button class="v-btn v-btn--line" type="button" data-quiz-back hidden><span>Back</span></button>
    <button class="v-link quiz__skip" type="button" data-quiz-skip>{% if mode == 'register' %}Skip the rest{% else %}Skip this question{% endif %}</button>
    <button class="v-btn v-btn--ink" type="button" data-quiz-next><span>Next</span></button>
    {%- if mode == 'app' -%}
      <button class="v-btn v-btn--accent" type="submit" form="{{ id }}-form" data-quiz-save hidden{% if mock %} disabled{% endif %}><span>Save my plan</span></button>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if mode != 'register' -%}
      <button class="v-btn v-btn--line" type="button" data-qz-retake hidden><span>Retake</span></button>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  {%- if mode == 'app' -%}
    {%- assign fid = id | append: '-form' -%}
    {%- assign rto = return_to | default: '/account?snh_posted=goals#goals' -%}
    {%- form 'customer', class: 'quiz__form', id: fid, data-shopify-captcha: 'true', data-snh-post: 'goals', return_to: rto -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[email]" value="{{ email | escape }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="" data-quiz-tags>
    {%- endform -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
<script src="{{ 'snh-phone.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
